<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Using E button </Major>
    <Description>This is a macro thats mining automaticly for you at the querry on Grand RP (any grand rp server)

Instructions:

1. Go to querry,
2. Go near or climb on top of the rocks.
3. When you see E button showing but start the macro.
4. Do the Captcha every 5-7 minutes.

Enjoy your easy money and ores :) </Description>
    <Comment>This macro will NOT solve the Captcha automaticly, you need to solve it manually ever 5-7 minutes.</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 8 1
Delay 5346 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 8 s
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 5346 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 8 s
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 5346 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 8 s
GoWhile 1 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>GTA 5 RP</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>